codex
The code now makes the retry boundary structural: discovery is the only operation inside the catch/reload path, while all readiness assertions run exactly once afterward. A missing diagnostic now fails capture explicitly; successful captures record `retryUsed` and the original error in hard-gate evidence, and retry use also emits the stable foreground marker.
